{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1325.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"bb7f2077cf103e96488ee70e4ece2671fd84100e747be82d820a9193ac732031","ja":"ロコも見てましたけど、\nコメントがいっぱい来てましたね！　","zh":"我也看了ROCO，\n收到了好多留言呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1325.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"030d18f4924f1be39cd3dcd13b27d70ca3f34d6ad57214d32e0f888c9ec3741f","ja":"「翼ちゃんの司会がうまい」って、\n大好評でしたね。","zh":"大家都夸“小翼主持得很棒”，\n反响非常好呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1325.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f004e1b761c4213a795fbb22549c17e15d6a7cfb3d2e1552d41ae7f2091cdb1a","ja":"もちろん、「歩ちゃんの反応がカワイイ」って\nコメントも、いっぱいありましたよ♪","zh":"当然，“步的反应好可爱”这种\n评论也有很多哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1325.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"3da8a65de253f648eb1a25b5fcbd5c70a75e0ad803e7dc4237a029dff9548cd8","ja":"翼がアタシのいいところ聞く、なんて\n始めるから……はぁ、みんなに変な姿見せちゃったよ。","zh":"都怪翼突然说要问我的优点……\n唉，让大家看到我丢脸的样子了啦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1325.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"03def228637470c687d54145388556743bda9271a19a3f8e112eef5440dac952","ja":"全然変な姿じゃなかったですよ～。\nテレてる歩さん、すっごくかわいかったです♪","zh":"一点都不奇怪哦～。\n害羞的步小姐，超级可爱的♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1325.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"0106fa13f216a329c9e2d75bdc81776e0709466e34c3a9b944c834365a18ceef","ja":"あゆあゆは、ず～っとかわいいもんね♪","zh":"步步一直都超可爱的嘛♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1325.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"e9ce3d0345c6b101bd3a96a8bceb2033d7004fe2bb56949468214c88f50ada2d","ja":"べ、別にそんなこと……。","zh":"才、才没有那回事……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1325.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"1ae2aa04806540296ab5bfbcca2cb370fe89b7a6a554f42d876a870967fb6593","ja":"えへへ、「映画が楽しみ」ってコメントもあったし、\nこの調子で2回目も成功させなきゃ♪","zh":"嘿嘿，还有留言说“很期待电影”呢，\n要照这个势头让第2次也大获成功才行♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1325.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"2f178747058f611d782139f8a280fe8f80b136ff724c5934882105a4457b5bca","ja":"次の配信はどんな内容にするか、\nもう決まってるんですか？","zh":"下一次直播要播什么内容，\n已经定下来了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1325.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"36c7f01f51c5eda0b4051c96d510c2e49751d04972614104e0018b861599cef3","ja":"新作ロコアートの発表会はどうですか？\nロコはみんなに見てもらいたいです！","zh":"新作ROCO艺术的发表会怎么样？\nROCO想让大家来看看！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1325.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"349b7a7898acc518b2e308215e31d899cd7736db9094b25f4c165eb86f20f299","ja":"それも面白そうだけど……。私はもう一回、\nあゆあゆのいいところ発表会がいいな～♪","zh":"虽然那样好像也挺有趣的……但我还是想\n再开一次阿步的优点发表会呢～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1325.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"bd097736b023ac2bcb3dad4a90c381f5a9fa14a79ae8e4d32246e962bc548ef7","ja":"あっ、それもいいかも～。次までに、\n今日言えなかったこと、考えてこれますもんね♪","zh":"啊，那样好像也不错～。这样下次之前，\n就能好好想想今天没能说出口的事情了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1325.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"dc3bdc9a4b3fb35a99c14aa2f06911daa9c2c59b1b45c7b9b8dc6b635fa0ceed","ja":"カンベンしてよ～……。","zh":"饶了我吧～……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1325.unity3d","item_key":"commands[51].text","source_sha256":"579ea810306d9315c499c907213e6091db8c9a18c86053167050097b197213b1","ja":"アタシの回は終わったの！\n次やるとしたら、アタシ以外だからな、翼！","zh":"我那一轮已经结束了！\n下次要是再搞，可就轮不到我了哦，翼！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
